<title>SOUTH KOREA: HYUNDAI MIPO DOCKYARD INTERIM NET DROPS.</title>
<headline>HYUNDAI MIPO DOCKYARD INTERIM NET DROPS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   104  vs 166</p>
<p>    Net					  0.83  vs 1.33</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			1.22  vs 1.96</p>
<p>    Turnover				 150.70  vs 135.98</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss		     0.54  vs none</p>
<p>NOTE: Hyundai Mipo Dock Yard Co Ltd, a member of Hyundai Group and one of the world's largest ship repair companies, said its interim net profits fell due to a drop in ship repair prices.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
